 **Multi-Server Architecture in `desktop_app/server_manager.py`**:\n   - Replaced single-directory manager with `MultiServerManager` and `ServerInstance`.\n   - Manages:\n     - `chatgpt`: Port 8000, model `gpt-4o`, dir `D:\\AI_Engineer\\MSEMAX`, url `http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/chat/completions`.\n     - `gaistudio`: Port 8001, model `gemini-3.8-flash`, dir `D:\\AI_Engineer\\MSEMAX-GAIStudio`, url `http://127.0.0.1:8001/v1/chat/completions`.\n   - Provides live socket port probing (`is_port_listening`), start, stop, test (live latency & ping), and `run_get_session`.\n4. **Backend pywebview API in `desktop_app/backend.py`**:\n   - Added:\n     - `get_servers_info()`: returns JSON status of both servers and the active server key.\n     - `start_server_instance(server_key)`: starts specific server.\n     - `stop_server_instance(server_key)`: stops specific server.\n     - `test_server_instance(server_key)`: pings server and returns latency + health.\n     - `run_server_session(server_key)`: runs `get_session.py` in that server's directory.\n     - `set_active_ai_server(server_key)`: 1-click active switch updating `settings.json` (`local_api_url`, `local_model`, `active_server`).\n5. **Universal Persian/OCR Normalization & Post-LLM Evaluator**:\n   - `src/match/text_match.py`: Added full mappings for `ڤ`, `ڥ`, `ڑ`, `اقراض` $\\rightarrow$ `اقراص`.\n   - `src/fast_match/search.py`: Added `'اقراض'` to `FORM_GROUPS['tablet']`.\n   - `src/fast_match/coordinator.py`: Post-LLM guard checks brand first-letter root, neo/new prefix, and enforces form differences to review.\n\n### In Progress:\n- Updating `desktop_app/templates/index.html` to add the Servers Tab in the sidebar and build the `screen-servers` view with cards, active switches, and live test buttons.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Key Findings\n- Port 8000 is running MSEMAX ChatGPT (`gpt-4o`).\n- Port 8001 runs MSEMAX Google AI Studio (`gemini-3.8-flash`).\n- Both servers use standard OpenAI-compatible `/v1/chat/completions` with bearer key `[REDACTED_CREDENTIAL]`.\n- Live socket check in `server_manager.py` allows the app to detect running servers even if they were launched from an external terminal or batch file.\n\n---\n\n## 4. Active Context\n- **Workspace**: `D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy`\n- **Python Environment**: `D:\\miniconda3\\envs\\venv\\python.exe`\n- **GAIStudio Path**: `D:\\AI_Engineer\\MSEMAX-GAIStudio`\n- **ChatGPT MSEMAX Path**: `D:\\AI_Engineer\\MSEMAX`\n- **Target File to Edit**: `desktop_app/templates/index.html`\n\n---\n\n## 5. Next Steps\n1. **Update `desktop_app/templates/index.html`**:\n   - Add the navigation button in `<nav class=\"nav-menu\">` right after the Terminal Logs button:\n     ```html\n     <button class=\"nav-item\" onclick=\"showScreen('screen-servers', this); loadServersUI();\">\n         <i class=\"ph ph-hard-drives\"></i> <span data-i18n=\"nav_servers\">إدارة السيرفرات (AI Servers)</span>\n     </button>\n     ```\n   - Add the `screen-servers` HTML section containing:\n     - Dual cards for **ChatGPT (Port 8000)** and **Google AI Studio (Port 8001)**.\n     - Status badges (🟢 متصل / 🔴 متوقف).\n     - Active server badge (⭐ المزود النشط للمطابقة).\n     - Action buttons for each card:\n       - `[تفعيل كمزود نشط]` (`setActiveServer('gaistudio' | 'chatgpt')`).\n       - `[تشغيل]` / `[إيقاف]`.\n       - `[اختبار الاتصال]` (`testServer('gaistudio' | 'chatgpt')`).\n       - `[فتح الجلسة]` (`openSession('gaistudio' | 'chatgpt')`).\n     - Live test output panel displaying latency and model reply.\n   - Add JavaScript functions `loadServersUI()`, `toggleServerInstance()`, `testServerInstance()`, `setActiveServer()`, `openServerSession()`.\n2. **Verify Python Compilation**:\n   - Run `& \"D:\\miniconda3\\envs\\venv\\python.exe\" -m py_compile desktop_app/server_manager.py desktop_app/backend.py src/fast_match/coordinator.py`.\n3. **Synchronize Production Package**:\n   - Run `& \"D:\\miniconda3\\envs\\venv\\python.exe\" scripts/package_production.py`.\n4. **Notify User**:\n   - Explain how the new Servers Tab works, confirm that the 404 issue is resolved, and provide instructions on how to start/switch between ChatGPT and Google AI Studio.\n\n---\n\n## 6. Commitments & Constraints\n- Must allow running both servers or switching batches to whichever server is selected as active.\n- Must provide a test button to send a sample ping and verify server responsiveness before running large matches.\n- Must ensure production sync via `package_production.py` after editing desktop app files.\n</summary>\n\nYou have the 238 following artifacts written to the artifacts directory:\n\n[ARTIFACT: agent]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.agents/agents/desktop-builder/agent.md\nLast Edited: 2026-09-21T22:17:02Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: agent]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.agents/agents/pharmacy-builder/agent.md\nLast Edited: 2026-09-21T10:46:04Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1790101953275]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.tempmediaStorage/media_1790101953275.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-22T18:32:33Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1790006220414]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.user_uploaded/media_1790006220414.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-21T15:57:26Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1790006245677]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.user_uploaded/media_1790006245677.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-21T15:57:26Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1790008142552]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.user_uploaded/media_1790008142552.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-21T16:29:03Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1790030764891]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.user_uploaded/media_1790030764891.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-2